  "content": {
    "id": "p50-group-6-8-root",
    "type": "question",
    "label": "4",
    "prompt": "Find the remainder when the following polynomials $P(x)$ are divided by $D(x)$.",
    "layout": "grid",
    "columns": 2,
    "questionDiagrams": [],
    "children": [
      {
        "id": "p50-q6",
        "type": "part",
        "label": "a",
        "prompt": "$P(x)=x^3+2x^2+3x+4$, $D(x)=x-1$",
        "layout": "list",
        "columns": null,
        "questionDiagrams": [],
        "children": [],
        "answer": {
          "short": "$10$",
          "worked": "By the remainder theorem, the remainder is $P(1)$.\n$$\\begin{align*}P(1)&=1^3+2(1)^2+3(1)+4\\\\P(1)&=10\\end{align*}$$",
          "solutionDiagrams": []
        },
        "answerSpaceMm": 28
      },
      {
        "id": "p50-q7",
        "type": "part",
        "label": "b",
        "prompt": "$P(x)=x^4+3x^2+2x+1$, $D(x)=x+1$",
        "layout": "list",
        "columns": null,
        "questionDiagrams": [],
        "children": [],
        "answer": {
          "short": "$3$",
          "worked": "By the remainder theorem, the remainder is $P(-1)$.\n$$\\begin{align*}P(-1)&=(-1)^4+3(-1)^2+2(-1)+1\\\\P(-1)&=1+3-2+1\\\\P(-1)&=3\\end{align*}$$",
          "solutionDiagrams": []
        },
        "answerSpaceMm": 36
      },
      {
        "id": "p50-q8",
        "type": "part",
        "label": "c",
        "prompt": "$P(x)=4x^3-3x^2-5x+8$, $D(x)=2x-3$",
        "layout": "list",
        "columns": null,
        "questionDiagrams": [],
        "children": [],
        "answer": {
          "short": "$\\dfrac{29}{4}$",
          "worked": "The zero of $2x-3$ is $\\dfrac32$, so the remainder is $P\\left(\\dfrac32\\right)$.\n$$\\begin{align*}P\\left(\\frac32\\right)&=4\\left(\\frac32\\right)^3-3\\left(\\frac32\\right)^2-5\\left(\\frac32\\right)+8\\\\P\\left(\\frac32\\right)&=\\frac{27}{2}-\\frac{27}{4}-\\frac{15}{2}+8\\\\P\\left(\\frac32\\right)&=\\frac{54-27-30+32}{4}\\\\P\\left(\\frac32\\right)&=\\frac{29}{4}\\end{align*}$$",
          "solutionDiagrams": []
        },
        "answerSpaceMm": 48
      }
    ]
  },
